  "description": "The Adventure Wagon is a Robust steed made to take on challenging terrain! Its our go to bike packing rig. Optimizing room for larger tires, this bike excels in the chunky stuff. The bike is designed around a slightly longer fork with more trail and a more stable riding platform when loaded. Thats not to say it won’t rip when shredding buffed out gravel! The Adventure Wagon comes exclusively with the Enve Adventure fork wich is Robust and capable. About 5mm longer than the Gravel fork but with more tire clearance and a “flip chip” dropout, allowing for two different fork rakes depending on your ride preference and intended use. The fork also comes with mounts for fenders, rack, anything cage mounts and internal dynamo routing. We are happy to offer the Adventure Wagon in titanium and Stainless steel. Ride, Camp, Adventure. GEOMETRY / SPECS / DETAILS - bellow -",
